WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.764
You didn't start your business

2
00:00:05.784 --> 00:00:07.522
to chase paperwork at night.

3
00:00:07.722 --> 00:00:10.731
Quorra Dispatch lets you quote, schedule

4
00:00:10.751 --> 00:00:13.216
send the crew, and get paid.

5
00:00:13.416 --> 00:00:14.890
All from one app.

6
00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:16.783
When someone fills out

7
00:00:16.803 --> 00:00:18.448
the form on your website

8
00:00:18.468 --> 00:00:20.763
it lands right on your leads board.

9
00:00:20.963 --> 00:00:22.851
You'll see who needs a call back

10
00:00:22.871 --> 00:00:24.849
and what each job is worth.

11
00:00:25.649 --> 00:00:27.761
Build a quote from your price book.

12
00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:31.980
Then send it by link, text, or PDF.

13
00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:34.067
Your customer can approve it

14
00:00:34.087 --> 00:00:35.948
and pick a time on their own.

15
00:00:36.748 --> 00:00:38.730
Booked jobs fill your calendar

16
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.526
with every tech assigned.

17
00:00:40.726 --> 00:00:42.931
So the whole crew knows where to be.

18
00:00:43.731 --> 00:00:46.636
On the road, your tech taps On my way

19
00:00:46.656 --> 00:00:48.303
to text the customer.

20
00:00:48.504 --> 00:00:50.264
Then checks in on arrival

21
00:00:50.284 --> 00:00:51.904
and starts the job.

22
00:00:52.704 --> 00:00:54.129
When the work is done

23
00:00:54.149 --> 00:00:55.974
take payment right there.

24
00:00:56.174 --> 00:00:58.530
Let your customer scan a QR code

25
00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:00.534
or hand them your phone to pay.

26
00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:04.387
By card, Apple Pay, or Google Pay.

27
00:01:04.587 --> 00:01:06.740
And the invoice is marked paid.

28
00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:10.083
You also get recurring service plans

29
00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:12.960
timesheets, and a customer portal.

30
00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:15.184
Where clients can review quotes

31
00:01:15.204 --> 00:01:16.753
and pay invoices.

32
00:01:17.553 --> 00:01:20.024
Plans start at $80 a month.

33
00:01:20.224 --> 00:01:22.368
And monthly plans get half off

34
00:01:22.388 --> 00:01:24.089
for the first three months.

35
00:01:24.289 --> 00:01:26.926
Start your 14-day free trial today.
